<title>ITALY: Brembo H1 1996 pretax profits fall.</title>
<headline>Brembo H1 1996 pretax profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons pretax profit		   25.705 vs  34.658</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			 190.175 vs 185.668</p>
<p>    Cash flow				34.001 vs  34.107</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin	     39.530 vs  44.653</p>
<p>    Operating margin		     26.584 vs  34.830</p>
